WEBVTT

00:38.120 --> 00:42.640
WHAT CAN MONEY BUY?

00:48.200 --> 00:51.840
This room is the lab for growing trees

00:51.920 --> 00:54.000
for the students who love nature.

00:55.120 --> 00:58.800
This room is the lab for tailoring

00:58.880 --> 01:00.880
for the students
who are interested in fashion.

01:01.960 --> 01:04.319
Although the school has many activities,

01:04.400 --> 01:06.440
we still give importance to studies.

01:06.520 --> 01:11.320
Most importantly,
we have received many awards.

01:21.080 --> 01:25.520
SPACECRAFT SIMULATION ROOM
MANIT PATNACHAI

01:26.600 --> 01:27.800
What's the matter?

01:28.720 --> 01:30.400
Whose names are these?

01:31.600 --> 01:35.720
Oh, these are the names of the parents
who have supported the rooms.

01:36.280 --> 01:38.160
Let's look at the other rooms.

01:46.320 --> 01:49.120
What can money buy?

01:53.280 --> 01:54.280
A room.

01:54.720 --> 01:55.920
Fame.

01:56.520 --> 01:57.720
Things.

01:58.360 --> 01:59.920
Social image.

02:02.400 --> 02:03.520
Maybe...

02:04.600 --> 02:06.560
money can buy more than that.

02:09.440 --> 02:11.280
These are all the rooms we have.

02:11.840 --> 02:15.160
The rest are empty until we get
more donations from the parents.

02:15.880 --> 02:17.920
Let me take you
to the classrooms downstairs.

02:18.000 --> 02:18.840
Let's go.

02:41.320 --> 02:42.440
What's the matter?

02:43.160 --> 02:44.880
If I wanted to buy this room,

02:45.480 --> 02:47.080
I could do that, right?

03:08.520 --> 03:09.600
Thank you.

04:43.880 --> 04:44.960
What will we eat tonight?

04:45.040 --> 04:47.960
-I want to go bowling.
-Hey, I want to have sushi.

04:48.040 --> 04:49.320
-Sushi.
-But when I see your hair,

04:49.400 --> 04:50.880
I want to have egg threads.

04:52.000 --> 04:53.880
-Ramen.
-Hey, it's in fashion right now.

04:53.960 --> 04:54.840
-Souvenirs.
-Hey!

04:59.280 --> 05:01.280
-Hey, why are you guys screaming?
-He bought so much.

05:01.360 --> 05:03.440
You're acting like you've never been
to England before.

05:03.520 --> 05:06.320
Hey, we screamed because...

05:06.400 --> 05:08.840
Guys, give me 2,000 baht each as promised.

05:08.920 --> 05:11.560
-It's our allowance. Hurry.
-Come on. Hurry.

05:13.160 --> 05:16.840
We made a bet if you would buy
more souvenirs than To.

05:16.920 --> 05:19.640
Damn. He has outdone you this time. Look.

05:20.240 --> 05:21.640
I thought I bought too much already.

05:22.440 --> 05:24.920
Damn! You bought more stuff than me!

05:26.400 --> 05:29.800
To, why didn't you follow him
to see what he bought

05:29.880 --> 05:31.840
and then buy one piece more than him?

05:31.920 --> 05:33.320
You traveled together, right?

05:33.400 --> 05:36.360
I made plans with him,
but he was never free to meet me.

05:36.440 --> 05:39.520
Hey, I had to spend time with my parents.
We don't see each other often.

05:40.080 --> 05:43.640
You invited me to a football match,
but booked seats behind the goal.

05:44.120 --> 05:45.400
I would rather watch on TV.

05:45.480 --> 05:48.960
DINO AND FRIENDS

05:49.040 --> 05:50.680
Dino?

05:50.760 --> 05:52.800
Well, he is the kind of person who...

05:53.480 --> 05:56.400
Actually, if I didn't know him,
I would think he's very arrogant

05:56.480 --> 05:59.200
because he's someone
who is kind of perfect.

05:59.280 --> 06:02.080
He's rich,
and his family is very influential.

06:02.160 --> 06:03.440
People don't really approach him.

06:03.520 --> 06:07.600
He's the kind of person who likes to buy
a lot of souvenirs for his friends.

06:07.680 --> 06:10.600
All the stuff he uses
and the car he drives

06:10.680 --> 06:13.280
are very expensive.

06:13.360 --> 06:18.160
It's the sort of thing my dad uses,
not what I use.

06:18.240 --> 06:21.160
I invited you for a meal at a hotel,
but you didn't go.

06:21.240 --> 06:23.200
Where did you go?
Did you eat duck at Four Seasons?

06:23.280 --> 06:24.720
That's like a Thai tour.

06:26.280 --> 06:29.840
You said there was a government minister
with you at the Tower Bridge,

06:29.920 --> 06:31.720
enjoying the scenery.

06:32.120 --> 06:33.440
Who would dare go?

06:34.600 --> 06:36.480
-To, you suck.
-What?

06:36.560 --> 06:38.640
-You should learn to socialize, too.
-Yeah.

06:38.720 --> 06:41.760
Just in case you become
a government minister in the future.

06:41.840 --> 06:43.760
I don't think I can become
a government minister.

06:43.840 --> 06:44.760
Fuck. You aim low.

06:45.320 --> 06:46.320
Dino?

06:46.800 --> 06:48.240
I think he likes to show off.

06:48.800 --> 06:50.880
I don't know.
Hey, this is just my opinion.

06:50.960 --> 06:52.520
I asked my friends for advice.

06:53.000 --> 06:55.320
I think he's a bit jealous of me.
I don't know.

06:55.880 --> 06:58.840
But Dino is really rich.

06:59.960 --> 07:01.280
He changes cars every day.

07:02.560 --> 07:05.200
I think he could be the owner
of this country.

07:06.320 --> 07:08.520
-Hey, guys.
-This jerk keeps cursing me.

07:08.600 --> 07:11.720
I saw Nanno's room just now.

07:11.800 --> 07:13.160
What the hell is that?

07:13.240 --> 07:14.680
Oh, that's the new student.

07:14.760 --> 07:17.880
She bought a room here on her first day.
She's very rich.

07:18.280 --> 07:19.280
Why did she buy it?

07:20.320 --> 07:21.720
To open a company.

07:23.120 --> 07:24.680
Hello, I'm Nanno,

07:24.760 --> 07:26.920
the owner of the room and the company.

07:43.880 --> 07:44.960
What does your company do?

07:45.920 --> 07:48.480
Hello, students.

07:48.560 --> 07:49.600
Fuck.

07:50.600 --> 07:51.440
Here she comes again.

07:51.560 --> 07:54.640
Welcome back to the school, everyone.

07:55.280 --> 07:58.840
Today, we will start the new term

07:59.480 --> 08:01.200
by giving out your grades
from the last term.

08:02.640 --> 08:03.800
I don't want it.

08:03.880 --> 08:07.240
What goes around comes around.

08:07.320 --> 08:10.400
-Here.
-Fuck. I don't want to see my grades.

08:12.720 --> 08:14.040
Let's open it at the same time.

08:14.120 --> 08:15.640
-At the same time?
-I got 2.48.

08:15.720 --> 08:16.800
One, two.

08:18.200 --> 08:20.800
Fuck. You got 3.36?

08:21.760 --> 08:23.280
Fuck. The world is unfair.

08:23.960 --> 08:25.880
Look at my grades.

08:26.720 --> 08:27.960
It's fucking bad.

08:28.040 --> 08:29.680
My dad will kill me for sure.

08:30.360 --> 08:31.880
The motorcycle that I want

08:31.960 --> 08:34.440
will definitely be reduced
to a scooter for grocery shopping.

08:35.919 --> 08:38.159
I can help you get the motorcycle.

08:38.799 --> 08:39.760
How?

08:40.919 --> 08:42.400
Come see me at my company.

08:43.840 --> 08:47.160
NANNO COMPANY LIMITED

08:50.160 --> 08:51.320
What kind of room is this?

08:51.760 --> 08:52.960
I don't know.

08:55.200 --> 08:57.600
Are you sure that I'll get the motorcycle?

08:58.600 --> 09:00.080
You'll get it for sure,

09:00.160 --> 09:04.160
but the process will require a little fee.

09:12.160 --> 09:13.040
It's this much.

09:14.760 --> 09:16.440
I think it's pretty cheap

09:16.520 --> 09:18.800
compared to the price
of the motorcycle that you want.

09:21.120 --> 09:23.240
Just try it. It's not expensive.

09:23.880 --> 09:25.400
-What do you think?
-It's not expensive.

09:27.240 --> 09:28.760
-Hurry.
-Just try it.

09:41.800 --> 09:44.200
I got everything. Thank you very much.

09:45.880 --> 09:47.400
Give me your report card.

09:47.960 --> 09:49.600
I'll process this right away.

09:52.160 --> 09:53.120
Just give it to her.

09:53.560 --> 09:54.560
Why does she want it?

09:55.000 --> 09:56.080
Just give it to her.

10:06.600 --> 10:08.640
Hey.

10:09.440 --> 10:11.440
It's starting.

10:11.520 --> 10:13.160
Hey!

10:13.720 --> 10:15.080
Hey!

10:15.160 --> 10:16.560
Fuck! My report card.

10:17.360 --> 10:18.360
Hey.

10:20.400 --> 10:23.120
Guys, look. She made that for him.

10:34.040 --> 10:35.040
How?

10:46.320 --> 10:49.800
-Hey, can this be used?
-Yeah, wait a second.

11:02.160 --> 11:03.680
Now, you'll get the motorcycle.

11:05.880 --> 11:06.840
Fuck.

11:08.040 --> 11:09.240
They look just the same.

11:09.320 --> 11:10.920
Yeah, they're the same.

11:12.640 --> 11:14.360
I can do other things as well.

11:15.120 --> 11:16.480
What else?

11:16.560 --> 11:18.440
Well, everything.

11:27.120 --> 11:29.760
NANNO COMPANY UNLIMITED

11:34.240 --> 11:36.920
Can Nanno Company really do everything?

11:37.000 --> 11:38.160
Look at that.

11:58.640 --> 11:59.840
Som cheated on me.

12:07.520 --> 12:09.560
-Pat!
-It's not over yet. You're begging?

12:10.960 --> 12:12.120
Hey, Pat!

12:12.800 --> 12:13.880
Pat!

12:15.080 --> 12:16.120
Pat!

12:17.640 --> 12:19.360
-Get some!
-Pat!

12:19.920 --> 12:20.760
Let go of him!

12:21.760 --> 12:23.760
Here. Get me a pretty one.

12:29.560 --> 12:31.040
You got yourself a girlfriend.

12:31.120 --> 12:32.280
As promised,

12:33.040 --> 12:34.440
here's a check for 500,000 baht.

12:35.000 --> 12:38.040
-Thank you, Dad.
-She's really adorable.

12:39.880 --> 12:42.320
CAN YOU DO THAT
FOR THE SAKE OF YOUR FRIEND?

12:42.400 --> 12:46.000
Okay, that's it for today.
See you all tomorrow.

12:47.320 --> 12:49.120
Goodbye, ma'am. I'm leaving.

12:50.560 --> 12:51.920
-Guys, let's go.
-Go where?

12:52.000 --> 12:54.760
-Dino, I have a question.
-I'm hungry.

12:55.560 --> 12:57.680
Don't you have anything
I can help you with?

12:57.760 --> 12:59.080
-I'm already hungry.
-No.

12:59.160 --> 13:00.600
Are you playing snooker alone?

13:00.680 --> 13:03.600
He doesn't need your help.

13:03.680 --> 13:05.880
His family is rich. He's a good student.

13:05.960 --> 13:09.200
His parents are living abroad.
He has no problem with his girlfriend.

13:09.280 --> 13:11.720
If you have any problem,

13:12.320 --> 13:13.640
Dino can help you.

13:14.360 --> 13:15.760
Are you crazy?

13:15.840 --> 13:17.920
Her company is so big.
Why would she need my help?

13:18.240 --> 13:19.200
Yeah, that's true.

13:19.280 --> 13:21.440
Don't worry about Nanno not having clients

13:21.520 --> 13:23.640
because the next one is me.

13:23.720 --> 13:25.120
What else do you need her help with?

13:25.600 --> 13:29.120
I want to go out, but not for clubbing
or anything like that.

13:29.200 --> 13:30.840
I want to go on an overnight trip,

13:30.920 --> 13:33.680
so I want Nanno to issue a letter
to my parents.

13:33.760 --> 13:36.160
Can it be a camp or something like that?

13:38.000 --> 13:39.160
What about Dhamma Camp?

13:39.680 --> 13:41.120
Okay, that's cool.

13:41.200 --> 13:43.280
Make Miss Pum the trip supervisor.

13:45.840 --> 13:47.080
-Let me go, too.
-Yeah.

13:47.160 --> 13:49.800
Why are you copying me?
You can't come up with it yourself?

13:49.880 --> 13:51.840
Of course I can.

13:51.920 --> 13:53.840
I'm thinking of going with everyone.

13:53.920 --> 13:56.560
-Tap, To, Nanno, and Dino, too.
-I'll join.

13:57.040 --> 13:58.680
-Unlike you.
-Yeah, right.

13:58.760 --> 14:00.720
Just let her go on a trip by herself.

14:00.800 --> 14:02.320
Hey, what the hell. Let me go, too.

14:02.400 --> 14:03.840
-No.
-I'll go, too.

14:03.920 --> 14:05.320
Are we going to Osaka?

14:05.400 --> 14:07.320
-Let me go, too.
-No, I'm bored already.

14:07.400 --> 14:09.320
-Let's go to Hong Kong. I want congee.
-No.

14:09.400 --> 14:11.520
-I want to wear bikinis.
-I'm going, too.

14:11.600 --> 14:14.040
I'm going, too. Hello.

14:14.120 --> 14:15.680
-I'm going, too.
-Okay.

14:16.160 --> 14:18.240
You can go, too. I feel bad for you.

14:18.320 --> 14:20.840
-Right.
-But you can't choose the location.

14:20.920 --> 14:23.120
-Hey.
-Dino, where do you want to go?

14:23.880 --> 14:25.120
I'm bored of going abroad.

14:26.040 --> 14:27.240
Fuck, he's bored.

14:27.320 --> 14:29.600
-Rich people are like this.
-Yeah, that's true.

14:29.680 --> 14:31.640
He has been traveling abroad
since he was ten.

14:31.720 --> 14:33.040
Who wouldn't get bored?

14:33.120 --> 14:35.600
Then let's go somewhere close to Thailand.

14:35.680 --> 14:37.600
No, I'm bored of Thailand.

14:37.680 --> 14:39.160
-Then what?
-What shall we do?

14:39.240 --> 14:40.200
Collect tea leaves.

14:40.280 --> 14:42.160
-You'll go to a tea plantation?
-I don't want to.

14:42.240 --> 14:43.720
Can I suggest a place?

14:46.160 --> 14:49.320
I want to go to Dino's house.

14:49.400 --> 14:52.160
-Damn.
-Shit, that's interesting.

14:52.240 --> 14:54.320
I've heard a lot about your house,

14:55.200 --> 14:57.840
so I want to see it with my own eyes.

14:58.600 --> 15:00.600
There's nothing at my house.
It's an ordinary house.

15:00.680 --> 15:03.880
From what I heard,
his house has a very big garden.

15:03.960 --> 15:06.800
There's a swimming pool,
a snooker room, a golf room, and more.

15:06.880 --> 15:09.120
You can probably ride horses there.
His house is quite big.

15:09.200 --> 15:13.400
There must be horses
costing a million baht each.

15:13.480 --> 15:14.880
From what I heard,

15:15.560 --> 15:17.040
he has everything

15:18.440 --> 15:20.520
that our houses

15:21.560 --> 15:22.760
don't need.

15:22.840 --> 15:24.760
Like servants
who will take off your shoes,

15:24.840 --> 15:28.360
and people to serve them breakfast in bed.

15:29.200 --> 15:31.600
I'm afraid my things will get broken.

15:31.680 --> 15:32.560
Oh, god.

15:32.640 --> 15:33.760
Hey.

15:33.840 --> 15:38.360
I promise that I'll take responsibility
if ever someone breaks something

15:38.640 --> 15:39.880
in your house.

15:40.240 --> 15:43.040
I want to visit your house
even just once in my life.

15:43.440 --> 15:45.480
It's not about the responsibility. It's...

15:45.560 --> 15:48.000
Come on, Dino.

15:48.080 --> 15:50.520
We are all your friends.
Trust your friends.

15:50.600 --> 15:53.240
Yeah, or maybe you don't
consider us your friends.

15:53.320 --> 15:56.360
-Yeah.
-No, all of you are my friends.

15:56.440 --> 15:57.920
-Come on.
-What's up with you?

15:58.000 --> 15:59.160
-Just this once.
-Please?

15:59.240 --> 16:01.000
-Do it for your friends.
-Take us.

16:01.080 --> 16:04.040
-Hey, do it for your friends.
-Hey, that's enough.

16:05.280 --> 16:06.160
Fine.

16:06.640 --> 16:07.520
That's it.

16:07.600 --> 16:10.640
-The golf room is mine. Don't come in.
-I'm reserving the light displaying room.

16:10.720 --> 16:12.280
-Take a room each.
-Take the light room.

16:14.840 --> 16:16.520
I'm leaving. See you.

16:16.600 --> 16:17.880
-Bye.
-See you tomorrow.

16:17.960 --> 16:19.160
See you tomorrow

16:19.720 --> 16:21.360
with the letter for Dhamma Camp.

16:23.000 --> 16:24.000
See you.

16:43.320 --> 16:47.320
GO HOME

16:52.840 --> 16:57.120
In 100 meters, turn left.
Your destination is on the right.

16:57.680 --> 16:58.840
Turn left over there.

17:13.319 --> 17:14.319
Park here, please.

17:17.040 --> 17:18.720
That's 540 baht.

17:48.280 --> 17:49.680
-Hello, Dad. Hello, Mom.
-Hello.

17:50.240 --> 17:52.480
You're back. Have you eaten?

17:53.040 --> 17:54.120
Yes, Dad.

17:54.800 --> 17:57.400
It's a bit messy.
Tomorrow is scheduled for delivery.

17:58.360 --> 17:59.520
Do you need my help, Mom?

17:59.800 --> 18:02.040
No, it's okay. Do your homework.

18:02.120 --> 18:03.360
We can do it ourselves.

18:03.440 --> 18:04.960
Yeah, it's okay.

18:06.960 --> 18:08.120
Let me help you, Mom.

18:08.200 --> 18:09.680
No.

18:09.760 --> 18:13.040
If you really want to help,
just study hard.

18:14.960 --> 18:15.800
Okay.

18:16.880 --> 18:18.840
How's everything at school?

18:20.120 --> 18:21.960
It's good, Dad.

18:22.600 --> 18:25.000
My friend sent a driver
to drop me off just now.

18:27.240 --> 18:28.880
-Wow, that's good.
-Yeah.

18:30.280 --> 18:32.040
I'm going to do my homework, Mom.

18:32.120 --> 18:33.040
Okay.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.240
Can you pass that to me, please?

18:42.360 --> 18:43.880
Yeah, unwrap that.

18:46.480 --> 18:49.800
WE CAN ALWAYS HIDE SECRETS

19:08.560 --> 19:12.040
Tell me when is convenient for you,
so I can issue a letter for the parents.

19:18.000 --> 19:20.320
I don't think I can let you come
to my house anymore.

19:29.000 --> 19:30.080
Let's go somewhere else.

19:36.920 --> 19:39.440
I already prepared a dress
for the party at Dino's house.

19:39.520 --> 19:42.520
I've come up with the theme.
The theme is "celebrity."

19:45.360 --> 19:47.920
No. Let's dress up as movie characters.

19:51.840 --> 19:54.200
I think luxurious suits
for the red carpet is better.

19:56.920 --> 19:59.040
Hey, can you guys stop blabbing?

19:59.120 --> 20:00.880
Just wear whatever you want to.

20:00.960 --> 20:01.960
This is annoying.

20:18.920 --> 20:19.920
Hello.

20:21.480 --> 20:22.920
I need your help,

20:23.360 --> 20:24.720
but can you keep it a secret?

20:25.560 --> 20:26.640
Sure.

20:26.720 --> 20:30.440
I always keep client information
strictly confidential.

20:33.200 --> 20:34.400
I want you...

20:36.160 --> 20:37.480
to change my friends' minds.

20:37.560 --> 20:39.200
Oh, why?

20:39.920 --> 20:44.080
Hey, I think it's easier to solve
the problem at your house,

20:44.160 --> 20:46.960
because your friends really want to go.

20:50.400 --> 20:52.480
-My house...
-Your house...

20:57.520 --> 21:00.080
-has a lot of valuable things.
-I see.

21:00.760 --> 21:02.080
So, I don't want them to come.

21:02.440 --> 21:03.560
Okay.

21:05.440 --> 21:08.480
Can you change their minds?

21:14.240 --> 21:15.680
Actually, I think it's better...

21:19.080 --> 21:20.840
if you can find another house
to replace mine.

21:21.200 --> 21:22.600
Is that what you want?

21:24.440 --> 21:25.320
Yeah.

21:26.360 --> 21:27.880
Get a house just like what I described.

21:28.200 --> 21:29.120
Sure.

21:29.880 --> 21:31.960
The processing fee is...

21:37.360 --> 21:38.560
200,000 baht.

21:39.040 --> 21:40.280
It's cheap, right?

21:41.880 --> 21:42.760
Yeah.

21:43.360 --> 21:46.240
Then please give me the cash tomorrow.

21:47.080 --> 21:48.160
Is that okay?

21:56.280 --> 21:57.160
Okay.

22:11.160 --> 22:12.160
Mom.

22:12.960 --> 22:13.960
Do you have any fruit?

22:14.040 --> 22:15.960
Oh, there's watermelon in the fridge.

22:21.160 --> 22:22.160
Did you find it?

22:24.160 --> 22:25.040
Yes, Mom.

22:29.960 --> 22:31.040
Dino,

22:32.000 --> 22:34.080
I'm sorry I didn't remove the seeds.

22:35.520 --> 22:36.440
It's okay, Mom.

22:41.000 --> 22:43.640
Have you received your bonus yet?
The loan sharks won't stop asking.

22:44.080 --> 22:46.400
Why do they keep on asking?

22:46.480 --> 22:48.200
They're acting like
they don't have children.

22:48.280 --> 22:50.480
-Have you received it?
-We need to pay for Dino's tuition.

22:50.560 --> 22:51.640
Have you received it?

22:51.720 --> 22:53.960
Yes, they already transferred it.

22:54.040 --> 22:55.720
-How much is it?
-It's 200,000 baht.

22:55.800 --> 22:57.280
Good. We can pay them back right away.

22:57.760 --> 23:01.600
Hey, if anyone doesn't pay them back,
they'll hire a gangster to kill them.

23:01.680 --> 23:03.120
Yeah, I know.

23:06.200 --> 23:08.160
Dino, you lied to us.

23:08.240 --> 23:11.400
Fuck! How did the people at our level
