Fuck. What should I do?

42:09.800 --> 42:11.240
It's not hard.

42:13.800 --> 42:15.520
Just do what you've always done.

42:34.560 --> 42:39.160
"DO IT" CAMP

43:06.160 --> 43:07.240
Dad, Mom.

43:17.720 --> 43:19.240
How was Dhamma Camp?

43:38.320 --> 43:40.200
Did you get sore doing the meditation?

43:45.160 --> 43:46.280
No, Mom.

43:49.680 --> 43:51.480
I forgot to give you
the mosquito repellant.

43:52.200 --> 43:53.440
I'm sorry.

44:00.280 --> 44:01.480
Eat, son.

44:20.320 --> 44:22.640
Pop, you should give more
than everyone else.

44:23.960 --> 44:25.160
I'm broke.

44:26.560 --> 44:29.920
Dino, you don't have to.
You had nothing to do with this.

44:30.360 --> 44:33.160
You're the owner.
You can clear things up for us.

44:41.320 --> 44:42.560
It's 350,000 baht.

44:43.520 --> 44:45.160
This should be enough
to shut their mouths.

44:48.360 --> 44:51.280
This includes the money to treat
your wounds and for compensation.

44:53.200 --> 44:55.240
Don't... Don't tell anyone.

44:58.440 --> 44:59.520
Do you want this?

45:12.960 --> 45:13.880
Dino.

45:14.800 --> 45:16.400
If you're going to Dhamma Camp,

45:17.160 --> 45:18.680
don't forget to tell us.

45:25.640 --> 45:26.920
And you,

45:27.000 --> 45:28.680
what do you think money can buy?

45:42.320 --> 45:45.400
Money is the most important thing
in my life.

45:45.480 --> 45:47.680
If you don't have money,
you can't do anything.

45:47.760 --> 45:51.920
I consider it as something I never lack.

45:52.000 --> 45:54.160
I don't know why I should live
without money.

45:54.240 --> 45:55.080
That's not life.

45:56.760 --> 45:59.280
I think I'll be shocked to death.

45:59.360 --> 46:02.840
If I see clothes that I like,
but I don't have money to buy them.

46:02.920 --> 46:04.680
Even just thinking about it
doesn't feel good.

46:06.600 --> 46:11.280
If I were to imagine myself as poor,
I can't think of how I would be right now.

46:11.360 --> 46:14.160
These days, I already get stressed
when I only have 2,000 baht with me.

46:14.240 --> 46:15.960
It can buy everything.

46:17.400 --> 46:19.880
We can even buy people with money.

46:19.960 --> 46:21.160
I came up with a project.

46:21.240 --> 46:23.640
When I grow up,
I want to contribute to society.

46:24.600 --> 46:29.800
I will buy 3,200 square meters of land
to build a temple

46:30.200 --> 46:33.880
and invite monks and goddesses
to make merits.

46:33.960 --> 46:36.640
I'll invite the poor people
and when they come,

46:36.720 --> 46:39.440
I'll give them rice just in case

46:39.960 --> 46:42.000
they have as much as I do
in their next lives.

47:51.120 --> 47:53.120
Subtitle translation by Tanida Itthiwat
